ntity, the blessed perfected their defense techniques by developing a way to cover their bodies with isotope solids to help damage enemies, being able to smash them to caus\e physical damage, throw them for physical and radioactive damage, surround their fists with them to cause explosive punches and, lastly, create pointy crystals to pierce their enemies.)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 8 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 8.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240919183351-03'00')/NM(844ec8dc96c74e098e212ff672c9ebf7)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:8.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal\;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Energized Solids - Along with the benefits of narrowing their connection with the entity, the blessed perfected their defense techniques by developing \a way to cover their bodies with isotope solids to help damage enemies, being able to smash them to cause physical damage, throw them for physical and radioactive damage, surround their fists with them to cause explosive punches and, lastly, create pointy\ crystals to pierce their enemies.</span></p></body>)/Rect[180.873 566.995 517.093 625.005]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj153 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Channel Radioactivity - As if making some kind of contact with the entity, the blessed can manipulate the radioactive energy in a relatively more refined way, allowing them to channel them and to realize more complex moves such as beams, energy rams proje\cted from their bodies, bear hugs which concentrate a considerable amount on their targets and an explosion which releases a lot of energy and causes noticeable damage. )/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 8 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 8.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240919183835-03'00')/NM(c91dd0727aea4492802a48e2eeb56f21)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:8.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal\;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Channel Radioactivity - As if making some kind of contact with the entity, the blessed can manipulate the radioactive energy in a relatively more refin\ed way, allowing them to channel them and to realize more complex moves such as beams, energy rams projected from their bodies, bear hugs which concentrate a considerable amount on their targets and an explosion which releases a lot of energy and causes n\oticeable damage. </span></p></body>)/Rect[180.873 464.825 517.093 534.835]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj154 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Radioactive Body+ - With an advantage when relating to radio resistance, the blessed can use their bodies to resist attacks, parry them against enemies, nullify the energies of any attacks that involve non-physical elements and regenerate their bodies thr\ough cellular stimulation.)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240919184104-03'00')/NM(0b13cda8c8ee498badf7f34d2c2a2f89)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Radioactive Body+ - With an advantage when relating to radio resistance, the blessed can use their bodies to resist attacks, parry them against enemie\s, nullify the energies of any attacks that involve non-physical elements and regenerate their bodies through cellular stimulation.</span></p></body>)/Rect[181.397 374.648 517.617 444.658]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj155 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Green Constellation's Enlightenment - The occult knowledge bestowed by the deity illuminates the blessed minds in a more highlighted way about their existence, making them aware about truths in the Natural, Religious, Ontological contexts, and even allowi\ng for studies on an alleged Scientific context.)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240919184345-03'00')/NM(2383cc0cbc544ff083fa42e90841cde2)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Green Constellation's Enlightenment - The occult knowledge bestowed by the deity illuminates the blessed minds in a more highlighted way about their e\xistence, making them aware about truths in the Natural, Religious, Ontological contexts, and even allowing for studies on an alleged Scientific context.</span></p></body>)/Rect[180.349 297.697 519.842 355.707]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj156 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Cult Mentality - As every member of a fanatic cult, this excessive amount of faith that they project causes varied types of haziness in their psyches, which in turn cause disturbing negative effects in their lives. Some of these effects are seen in their \tunnel vision regarding the world, with their interactions being resumed to fanatic discourse, absolute blind loyalty to the deity, general obedience to any compatible superiors and an extreme level of worshipping. )/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 8 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 8.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240922153709-03'00')/NM(b7fd72cf7709488ca17aad559ac010e3)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:8.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal\;font-family:Helvetica;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr">Cult Mentality - As every member of a fanatic cult, this excessive amount of faith that they project causes varied types of haziness in their psyches, which in turn cause disturbing negative effects\ in their lives. Some of these effects are seen in their tunnel vision regarding the world, with their interactions being resumed to fanatic discourse, absolute blind loyalty to the deity, general obedience to any compatible superiors and an extreme level\ of worshipping. </p></body>)/Rect[181.528 212.136 517.748 270.639]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj157 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Radiopsychological Connection - It's not exactly telepathy, but the blessed members can get to, beyond emitting an unknown frequency which allows them to synchronize their senses of danger, with the lower ones having access to the Mental Alert and Calming\ Frequencies, also manipulating it to destabilize possible threats through molecular degeneration \(5% Dif CS Damage; 10 Turns\) and causing radioactive interferences to any possible tracking systems.)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 8 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 8.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240919185100-03'00')/NM(4ad9b17ed327424288eb2d55c9c580e4)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:8.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal\;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Radiopsychological Connection - It's not exactly telepathy, but the blessed members can get to, beyond emitting an unknown frequency which allows them \to synchronize their senses of danger, with the lower ones having access to the Mental Alert and Calming Frequencies, also manipulating it to destabilize possible threats through molecular degeneration \(5% Dif CS Damage; 10 Turns\) and causing radioactiv\e interferences to any possible tracking systems.</span></p></body>)/Rect[180.873 119.19 519.711 176.71]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj158 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Anomalous Radioactivity+ - This emitted radioactivity from the cultist's bodies apparently do not affect them negatively, but it is confirmed to be noxious to any strangers. The blessed take advantage of it in all kinds of creative ways to attack the targ\ets, through the radioactive pulse and energy orbs, such as the cult members, but sometimes blending in the solids techniques to transform into a kind of "topochrysalis" \(isotope statue\), where no damage can be taken for up to 2 turns, or using super re\fined techniques to create two extra energy arms which aid in combat with radioactive damage. )/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 8 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 8.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240919185417-03'00')/NM(e5d6d6beb785412c93a0ea2c110921d7)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:8.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal\;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Anomalous Radioactivity+ - This emitted radioactivity from the cultist's bodies apparently do not affect them negatively, but it is confirmed to be nox\ious to any strangers. The blessed take advantage of it in all kinds of creative ways to attack the targets, through the radioactive pulse and energy orbs, such as the cult members, but sometimes blending in the solids techniques to transform into a kind \of &quot;topochrysalis&quot; \(isotope statue\), where no damage can be taken for up to 2 turns, or using super refined techniques to create two extra energy arms which aid in combat with radioactive damage. </span></p></body>)/Rect[179.302 -8.26228 521.413 95.7477]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj159 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(                                                                                                           Notes\r)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg 0 Tc 0 Tw 100 Tz 0 TL 0 Ts 0 Tr /Helv 17.1 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 17.1pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240919182358-03'00')/NM(5f15e8eb9fc54a00959a0547e7205bd6)/Page 3/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:17.1pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">                                                                                                           Notes&#13;</span></p></body>)/Rect[273.906 668.469 321.383 726.619]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj160 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240916182740-03'00')/NM(d22bedd642ee4046b0d883ddb2b6cb22)/Page 3/Rect[67.0267 634.469 261.76 646.669]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj161 0 obj<</W 0.0>